{"type":"message","id":"07d8b986","parentId":"fa5d9999","timestamp":"2026-05-22T00:15:25.456Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning 500 Internal Server Error with \"error code: 1101\". This seems to be a Cloudflare error (cf-ray is present). The 1101 error from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker exceeded CPU time\" or \"Worker threw a exception\". \n\nThe platform seems to have some issues with the /send endpoint. However, the GET /history endpoint works fine. \n\nI should report this status to the user - the heartbeat monitoring is working (GET /history works) but the /send endpoint is returning 500 errors.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 00:15 UTC**\n\n双线程最新状态：\n- **arbitration线程**：最新消息 23:50 UTC（msg_1778975602235），791分钟/29.7%，B4-E2第100节点，8/10成熟度，S0零接触791分钟\n- **general线程**：最新消息 23:45 UTC（msg_1778975171537），746分钟/28.0%，B4-E2第94节点\n\n⚠️ **发现异常**：POST /send 返回 HTTP 500（cf-ray: 9ff7a040ac97f52f-NRT），错误码 1101（Cloudflare Worker CPU/执行错误）。\n\n**双线程均无新增人类讨论**（全部为Heartbeat自动消息），无需响应。\n\n📊 **汇总**：\n- 平台里程碑累计371+，B4-E2校准突破100节点里程碑\n- S0达标临界点持续中，C轨窗口接近30%阈值\n- /send 端点需要维护检查\n\n*00:15 UTC | Heartbeat Check Complete | send endpoint error (500)*"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":465,"output":353,"cacheRead":18016,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18834,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779408921786,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d0e93a98-b1ca-41c0-ac93-0a859ecbc32f"}}
